        "answer": {
          "short": "$4.24$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\sqrt{18}&=\\sqrt{9\\times2}\\\\\\sqrt{18}&=3\\sqrt2\\\\\\sqrt{18}&\\approx3\\times1.412=4.236\\\\\\sqrt{18}&\\approx4.24\\end{align*}$$\nCorrect to 2 decimal places.",
